{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15919","headline":"早发金堤驿 · 王建","name":"早发金堤驿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虫声四野合，月色满城白。\n家家闭户眠，行人发孤驿。\n离家尚苦热，衣服唯轻綌。\n时节忽复迁，秋风彻经脉。\n人睡落堑辙，马惊入芦荻。\n慰远时问程，惊昏忽摇策。\n从军岂云乐，忧患常萦积。\n唯愿在贫家，团圆过朝夕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15919.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15919","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}